Swift __SWIFT_VERSION__, iOS __DEPLOYMENT_TARGET__+, SwiftUI, __ARCHITECTURE_NAME__ on __BUILD_SYSTEM__.

## Commands

| Action | Command |
|--------|---------|
| Generate Xcode project | `__GENERATE_COMMAND__` |
| Run tests | `__TEST_COMMAND__` |
| Lint | `swiftlint lint --config .swiftlint.yml` |
