## Style guardrails

- 2-space indent everywhere
- `@Observable @MainActor` ViewModels (not `ObservableObject`)
- `async/await` and actors; no `DispatchQueue`
- Sorted imports
- No `print`, no `fatalError`, no force-unwrap (`!`)
- No `// swiftlint:disable` directives — fix the root cause

## Architecture

`__ARCHITECTURE_NAME__`. See `README.md` and `CLAUDE.md` for module map + dependency direction.

## Definition of done

A task is done when:

1. `swiftlint lint --config .swiftlint.yml` prints 0 violations
2. `__TEST_COMMAND__` passes
3. New code follows the existing file/folder conventions in this repo
